        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1490400?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Mouse and Wheel Events interfaces are moving from the UI Events specification to the Pointer Events specification. This PR attempts to make the move as smoothly as possible.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">No test change, only documentation.</p>\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3805715905\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/issues/564\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/pointerevents/pull/564/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/pull/564\">w3c/pointerevents#564</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3810188653\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/411\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/uievents/pull/411/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/uievents/pull/411\">w3c/uievents#411</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3895963639\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43011\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43011/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43011\">mdn/content#43011</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3814461733\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3690\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3690/hovercard\" href=\"https:/